	(text "DESIGN NOTES\n\n• Input: 3.8V-4.2V DC (Single-Cell Li-Ion)\n• Output: 3.3V DC, 500mA Max\n• LDO: LP5912-3.3DRVR\n• Reverse Polarity Protection: Q1 (P-MOSFET)\n• Overcurrent Protection: F1 (PTC Fuse)\n• Transient Protection: D1 (TVS Diode)\n• Gate Protection: D2 (Zener Diode)\n• Power Indicator: Green LED on VOUT\n• Test Points: VIN (TP1), VOUT (TP2), GND (TP3)\n• Operating Temperature: 0°C to 70°C"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 33.274 165.354 0)
